  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#entry-settings-object defines the \"entry settings object\" as the environment settings object of the current realm, but the definition of \"environment settings object\" confusingly links to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-realm-settings-object instead of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#environment-settings-object .",
